 "source_instruction": "i am looking for a short sleeve deep v neck solid color crop top.",
 "query": "Ugh, you will not believe how chaotic my walk to the library was this morning! I stopped to grab an iced oat milk latte from the campus cart, and right as I was fumbling to pull my student ID out to scan into the building, a squirrel darted straight at my feet, I jolted so hard half the drink sloshed onto the cuff of my favorite high-waisted cargo jeans. I had to duck into the gender-neutral restroom by the lecture hall to blot it with a crumpled paper towel for five whole minutes, and I still showed up to my 8 a.m. media studies quiz two minutes late with a faint coffee splotch that I swear everyone sitting in the front row was staring at. I\u2019m browsing the women\u2019s bodysuit tops section right now, can you help me find options that are cap sleeve, under $30, and have that one print I always go for? Oh, and make sure every option you pull has a built-in removable bra pad set too, I swear those make layering so much easier when I\u2019m running between classes and my part-time caf\u00e9 shift. I don\u2019t want anything super sheer that I have to layer an extra cami under, just the regular stretchy everyday fit would be perfect.",
